{"id":"ca317ab16dd3c14a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbmonoderivative.md","title":"导数单调判据与最优角点","display":"thm-pbmonoderivative — 导数单调判据与最优角点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbmonoderivative","aliases":["27-thm-pbmonoderivative"],"display":"thm-pbmonoderivative — 导数单调判据与最优角点","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbmonotone]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.2, Theorem 13.18","source_printed_pages":"596","source_pdf_pages":"620","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbmonoderivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbmonoderivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbmonoderivative — 导数单调判据与最优角点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab9dad394482d61d\" href=\"?note=ab9dad394482d61d\" title=\"27-df-pbmonotone\">27-df-pbmonotone</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.2, Theorem 13.18"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"596"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"620"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i,\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\">\\(J_i,\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab9dad394482d61d\" href=\"?note=ab9dad394482d61d\" title=\"27-df-pbmonotone\">27-df-pbmonotone</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(s\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 满足：每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>，若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_if\">\\(J_if\\)</span>处处非负则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i=1\">\\(s_i=1\\)</span>，否则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i=0\">\\(s_i=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(f\\in\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\ge0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(f\\in\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\ge0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(f\\in\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\le0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(f\\in\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\le0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\Longrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)\\le f(s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\Longrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)\\le f(s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必要性比较只差一个坐标的点。充分性把任意x≤y的零位逐个改为1，逐步不减。对一般坐标方向，从任意x逐坐标改为s_i时函数不减；零导数取1也是合法的最优选择。这里给值与角点正确性，不假设给定多项式时识别坐标单调是容易的。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbmonotone","status":"resolved","id":"ab9dad394482d61d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbmonotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbmonotone","status":"resolved","id":"ab9dad394482d61d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$J_i,\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbmonotone]]。$s\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$ 满足：每个$i\\in[n]$，若$J_if$处处非负则$s_i=1$，否则$s_i=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"J_i,\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"J_if","display":false},{"tex":"s_i=1","display":false},{"tex":"s_i=0","display":false},{"tex":"(f\\in\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\ge0).","display":true},{"tex":"(f\\in\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\le0).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\Longrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)\\le f(s)).","display":true}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbmonoderivative|thm-pbmonoderivative — 导数单调判据与最优角点]]"}],"outgoing":["ab9dad394482d61d"]}